  m_Name: Journal_JamieLetter
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Jamie.Gameplay.JournalEntry
  title: Jamie's Letter
  body: "Happy Birthday Alfie!\n\n\nThank you for sticking by me during my worst!\n\n\nCan't wait to get well so we can travel to Machu Picchu.\n\n\nHope you like the present. That's a little reminder that you can still pursue your dreams!\n\n\nAll the best, Jamie"
